flowchart TD
    A[Mad voice / loud voice] --> B[Adult: Take a deep breath]
    B --> C[Child takes deep breath]
    C --> D[Adult: Count to 4]
    D --> E[Child counts: 1, 2, 3, 4]
    E --> F{Softer voice and calmer body?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Adult: Nice calm voice]
    F -- No --> H[Repeat calmly: Deep breath, count to 4]
    H --> C
    G --> I[Return to activity]
    I --> J[Track calm-down win]
